# This Vercel project serves ONE thing: the read-only MULTIPLY notes at
# /multiply/read/, rewritten to the root. It deploys from the repo root rather
# than from multiply/read/ because that page imports ../notes.js and reads
# ../../devo/nasb-split/ — both outside its own folder.
#
# So: exclude everything, then re-admit only what that page actually needs.
# Keeps the upload at ~6.5 MB instead of the whole site.

/*

!/vercel.json
!/multiply

# Scripture data — per-chapter JSON the notes page fetches on demand.
!/devo
/devo/*
!/devo/nasb-split
